N2  - The proceedings contain 12 papers. The topics discussed include: explainable game strategy rule learning from video; towards complex event processing for clinical decision support using FHIR; GPT-3 for decision logic modeling; multi-agent online planning architecture for real-time compliance; an ontology-based approach for detecting and classifying inappropriate prescribing; reasoning about ingredient substitutions with ontologies and rules; reasoning over health records with Vadalog: a rule-based approach to patient pathways; towards a human-centered framework for the assessment of subjective social values in buildings; semantic querying of integrated raster and relational data: a virtual knowledge graph approach; and towards techniques for updating virtual knowledge graphs.
